      "sourceTextSha256": "8c8fe040f01907cb587f7a0375c5a0d4c8f020776eed25f6688e392a46e9e7ab",
      "text": "Transfer from Bonito to Campo Grande, fly to São Luís and transfer to your hotel.\n\nSão Luís is the capital of the state of Maranhão. The French founded the city in 1612, and the Portuguese later took control. That history is reflected in the city’s architecture and cultural heritage.\n\nThe historic centre of São Luís is a UNESCO World Heritage Site, with many surviving buildings from the 17th and 18th centuries. One of the most distinctive architectural details is the colourful azulejos, the ceramic tiles that decorate the façades. Walking through the old neighbourhoods, you can see how the colonial buildings remain part of the city’s daily life.",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-amanda-mw6jtvf2-93zmwk49h",
        "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
